WolOS certificate trust store (ADR 0046)

roots/          the two pinned WolOS roots, A and B (*.wolcert)
intermediates/  the Authors CA, Packages CA and Index certificates (*.wolcert)
revoked.json    the revocation list of the image, with revoked.json.wsig

All of them are public. They come from the public/ folder that `woltrust init` writes; until the
lead has run it, this folder holds no root, and every author signature counts as not checkable.
A root whose label starts with "test" (the TEST authority of the woltrust crate) is never loaded,
and the build refuses an image that holds one. Newer intermediates and lists that the update-check
service verified are kept in /var/lib/wolos/trust/.
